Aim-To recover deleted files from disk image of using the sketch kit and autospy and to analyze file metadata (timestamps,ownership) to Interpet digital evidence and reconstruct user activity.

Theory:

>The process of preventing, identifying and analyzing digital data for use in legal processdings.

>A command line collection that passes file system structures to recover data and read metadata without altering evidence.

>Key timestamps recorded by file systems:

Modification [M]

Access [A]

Creation [c]

Methodology:

Part A: Setup Analysis                

 >Install                                   
 >Launch Autopsy
 >Create Case                                              
 >Add Data Source
 >Ingest Modules                                                

Part B:Recoving Deleted Files                                                 
 >Using Terminal                                           
 >List Deleted files
 >Recover file                                                 
 >Using Autopsy
 >Navigate to "File view"                                                   
 >File with red 'x'
 >Select extract file
                                                      

Part C: Inspecting Meta-data

>Using Terminal

>Using Autopsy

